# Chatterbox Turbo container dependencies (Python 3.11, linux/x86_64, NVIDIA Blackwell RTX PRO 6000).
#
# chatterbox-tts 0.1.7 pins torch==2.6.0, whose wheels have no sm_120 (Blackwell) kernels.
# We therefore install torch 2.8.0 built for CUDA 12.8 from here and install chatterbox-tts
# itself with --no-deps (see Dockerfile). Everything chatterbox imports is listed explicitly,
# minus gradio (UI only, not needed by this service).
--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu128

